# Build context hygiene for the root Dockerfile (see docs/deployment.md).
#
# Without this file the context is ~2.1 GB and every `docker build` / `fly deploy`
# uploads node_modules, .next, .git and the demo video. The image needs only
# frontend/ sources + lockfile + patches; deps are installed and Next is built
# inside the image.

# --- VCS / tooling ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.claude
.specstory
.remember

# --- Dependencies + build output (reinstalled/rebuilt in-image) ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/.turbo
out
dist
build

# --- Secrets: never copy real env files into an image layer ---
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# --- Audiveris: built from source in the audiveris-builder stage ---
scripts/audiveris/vendor
scripts/audiveris/tessdata
scripts/audiveris/input
scripts/audiveris/output

# --- Large assets not used at runtime ---
# Root-anchored (leading /) so frontend/public/brand — which IS shipped — survives.
*.mov
*.mp4
/poster
/brand
/miscellaneous
/docs
/notes

# --- Docker / compose (not needed inside the image) ---
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml

# --- Local noise ---
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log
dev.log
npm-debug.log*
coverage
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
